# Game Engine Rules

Preferred model:

`GameState + GameAction -> GameTransition`

Core approved invariants:
- Stacks are atomic; no splitting.
- Association Card inactive in Tableau.
- Association Card may move onto matching Member Stack.
- Member Stack cannot move onto inactive Association Card.
- Association Stack cannot receive Members in Tableau.
- Empty Tableau accepts any movable unit.
- Automatic reveal costs no Move.
- Stock shows up to 3 visible; only final/top card playable.
- Restore Stock is unlimited, same remaining order, costs 1 Move.
- Every valid Move costs 1.
- Invalid move costs 0 and resets streak counter.
- Hint suggests only.
- Undo cannot reverse Association completion.
- Win clears all cards.
- Fixed visible Move Limit per Level.
- Restart generates a new valid shuffle.
- Generated board accepted only if Solver-valid within Move Limit.

Gameplay implementation is not complete without tests.
